# Store credentials, if needed later, belong on the server only.
# Never prefix secrets with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Public recommendations: server-only variables supplied by the Upstash integration.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
# Legacy Vercel integration names KV_REST_API_URL / KV_REST_API_TOKEN are also accepted.
